    {
      "summary": "Drawing controls & keyboard",
      "text": "Drawing controls & keyboardDrag with Pen, Box, or Arrow. Move selects a mark; Erase removes one. Use Add box for a label. All drawing controls change only temporary marks.Tab to a mark; arrow keys move it. Shift + arrows resize a box or move an arrow’s endpoint. Delete removes the focused mark. Focus the paper and press Enter to add a box, or choose Arrow first to add an arrow. P / B / A / V / E select tools. Command/Ctrl Z undoes; add Shift to redo. Clear sheet can also be undone."
    }
  ],
